WEBVTT

00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:38.120
Sebring is a still, small town with a quiet rhythm of its own,

00:00:38.120 --> 00:00:43.480
where people relax comfortably the whole year round in the Florida sun.

00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:46.090
Almost the whole year round, that is.

00:00:46.090 --> 00:00:57.270
Once a year in March, tempo picks up.

00:00:57.270 --> 00:01:00.000
The town plays host to one of the most colorful events

00:01:35.240 --> 00:01:40.440
one week of the year, the quiet of Sebring and this abandoned military airfield just

00:01:40.440 --> 00:01:47.000
outside the town will be shattered. That week is about to begin.

00:03:00.920 --> 00:03:15.590
*music*

00:03:46.960 --> 00:03:52.530
and highways of the nation coming with sounds and shapes and forms unique to

00:03:52.530 --> 00:04:00.000
any but a racing capital over 50,000 fans spectators and participants converge on

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:06.600
this small town for the Sebring 12-hour International Grand Prix of Endurance.

00:04:35.050 --> 00:04:50.620
In two short days since the first sports car gunned its way through the town, the town is changed, and the excitement of things to come splinters into colorful fragments of cars and people around its hub.

00:04:50.620 --> 00:04:59.730
There are people in a hurry.

00:05:00.030 --> 00:05:15.990
And guys who have all the time in the world.

00:05:15.990 --> 00:05:24.480
And so, for everyone, Sebring, in Race Week, is the place to be, if you can find a place

00:05:24.480 --> 00:05:25.060
to stay.

00:05:50.730 --> 00:05:55.390
65 of the finest cars made anywhere in the world come to Sebring

00:05:55.390 --> 00:06:00.000
by invitation only to be tested here in the biggest challenge for

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:04.360
cars on the American continent. The hangars still bordering the airport

00:06:04.360 --> 00:06:10.080
become garages. Mechanics wanting no part of sun and having no time for

00:06:10.080 --> 00:06:17.170
relaxation get down to work. They set up shop, pull out and set down their tools,

00:06:17.170 --> 00:06:23.220
the instruments of their profession. These are the wizards with wrenches who

00:06:23.220 --> 00:06:25.160
perform for the age of the machine.

00:07:24.570 --> 00:07:30.000
time for adjustment and tuning and readjusting is done. Cars must pass officially

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:59.410
inspection ladies spectators but this is no special ladies day at Sebring

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:08.580
Women are part of the crews, and some will race for the same reasons and the same odds as men.

00:09:00.280 --> 00:09:02.200
A road race is just that.

00:09:03.490 --> 00:09:07.290
Every competition car must meet the technical requirements.

00:09:08.660 --> 00:09:11.480
They must be set up with the same components and characteristics

00:09:11.480 --> 00:09:16.120
of any sports car that would be used by the public on regular roads.

00:09:16.960 --> 00:09:28.240
If someone checks out, they're still the big question.

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:45.270
will it do on the track? There's only one way to find out. Test it. Sebring is the longest

00:09:45.270 --> 00:09:51.720
road race in the United States. Its torturously twisting 5.2 mile course is a supreme test

00:09:51.720 --> 00:09:58.060
of skill and endurance. It is blacktop and concrete condensed into the worst of all possible

00:09:58.060 --> 00:10:00.000
roads and at the same time...

00:10:00.510 --> 00:10:03.300
the best of all possible straightaways.

00:10:32.040 --> 00:10:41.040
Sebring is bumps and S's and skids and it's the driver learning what his car can do.

00:11:27.840 --> 00:11:28.340
Race Morning.

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:36.370
has come. Hours before starting time, the fans pour into the airport and race areas.

00:12:35.280 --> 00:12:40.300
The moment that is Sebring is almost here.

00:12:40.300 --> 00:12:46.920
All the training, conditioning, inventing, planning will end in 12 hours with heartbreak

00:12:46.920 --> 00:12:53.620
for some and triumph for others.

00:13:14.970 --> 00:13:20.590
Only the best race at Sebring, and the starting field includes drivers from around the world:

00:13:20.590 --> 00:13:30.000
Scotland, Belgium, Germany, Canada, France, Switzerland, Sweden, Holland, England, Iceland,

00:13:30.700 --> 00:13:39.170
Italy, South Africa, Argentina, Mexico, New Zealand, Puerto Rico, and the United States.

00:13:39.170 --> 00:13:43.410
They're going to find out who's who and what's what.

00:17:44.200 --> 00:17:46.410
Pit stops begin.

00:17:46.410 --> 00:17:50.290
Cars pit for fuel, tires, repairs, and a change of drivers.

00:18:09.760 --> 00:18:11.760
with tension and frustration.

00:18:11.760 --> 00:18:14.420
Each car has a team of two drivers

00:18:14.420 --> 00:18:17.670
who spell each other over a long, grinding day.

00:18:59.500 --> 00:19:00.000
use the drugs.

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:08.120
The spectators show their own kind of endurance, impatient and idle waiting from dawn to night.

00:19:08.120 --> 00:19:15.400
This dedicated standing by on the part of race fans is found in few other sports.

00:20:14.110 --> 00:20:20.320
wears away into dusk, and another hazard begins as the dwindling light and growing shadows

00:20:20.320 --> 00:20:25.380
play tricks on the twisting course. The battle against the clock seems never ending.

00:20:32.560 --> 00:20:44.350
The vicious pace begins to show on machines, on men, and on nerves.

00:20:44.350 --> 00:20:47.780
International endurance racing, pit stops,

00:20:47.780 --> 00:20:51.820
can be demonstrations of inspired madness.

00:20:51.820 --> 00:20:56.920
Things that have been working for hours suddenly become inoperative.

00:20:56.920 --> 00:21:00.000
Various metal parts become inexplicably

00:21:00.120 --> 00:21:05.160
red hot, and all boats reverse their threads.

00:21:05.160 --> 00:21:11.430
The crews respond with activity that is a kind of explosion of colorful incomprehensibility.

00:22:48.080 --> 00:22:53.190
last grinding hours when everything is wearing out and the strong are pressing

00:22:53.190 --> 00:23:00.000
and the fading are trying to hold then is when this Grand Prix of endurance begins to

00:23:00.000 --> 00:23:04.450
have a quality all of its own.

00:24:04.510 --> 00:24:07.660
Twelfth hour, and the minutes leap past.

00:24:09.060 --> 00:24:11.210
Someone fades out in the darkness.

00:24:12.420 --> 00:24:16.130
And someone else springs out from the flashing lights to win.

00:24:16.930 --> 00:24:26.510
A new winner joins the ranks of the greats at Sebring.

00:25:01.310 --> 00:25:06.860
The airport that beat to new and strange rhythms is quiet again.

00:25:06.860 --> 00:25:13.120
Sebring and those who were just passing through, both somewhat out of breath,

00:25:13.120 --> 00:25:18.020
settle back to being themselves again until next year.
